, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tabd,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100\\\", 120\\\", and 150\\\", providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What inputs are available on this LED wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to meet modern gaming standards.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the GameWall 240Hz different from traditional gaming monitors or TVs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike conventional monitors, the GameWall offers a significantly larger LED canvas with superior brightness (1000 nits) and a pixel pitch of 1.5mm for sharp visuals. Its massive scale and professional gaming features create a truly immersive experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complicated for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires professional handling due to the size and complexity of the LED panel. Our team can provide full installation services to ensure optimal setup and display calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty coverage comes with the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance issues. Typical coverage includes parts and labor for a set term\\u2014specific warranty details can be provided upon inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which gaming environments are best suited for the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall is perfect for gaming rooms, esports training facilities, sim racing setups, and VR lounges. Its size and performance enhance immersion and competitive responsiveness in these applications.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"GameWall 240Hz\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T66a,<h1>GameWall 240Hz</h1><p>Elevate gaming with GameWall 240Hz LED display in Dubai. Ultra-smooth visuals from Brightluxx UAE. Request your demo today!</p><p><strong>240Hz LED wall built for competitive and immersive gaming.</strong></p><p>GameWall is purpose-built for gamers who demand the largest, fastest display possible. 240Hz native refresh rate with under 3ms input lag delivers competitive-grade responsiveness on a massive LED canvas. VRR (Variable Refresh Rate) support for both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates tearing. Game-specific display modes for FPS, racing, and RPG genres. HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs support 4K@240Hz.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.</p><h3>What are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.</p><h3>How does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?</h3><p>It supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.</p><h3>What inputs are available on this LED wall?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to m