largest, fastest display possible. 240Hz native refresh rate with under 3ms input lag delivers competitive-grade responsiveness on a massive LED canvas. VRR (Variable Refresh Rate) support for both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates tearing. Game-specific display modes for FPS, racing, and RPG genres. HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs support 4K@240Hz.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.</p><h3>What are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.</p><h3>How does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?</h3><p>It supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.</p><h3>What inputs are available on this LED wall?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to meet modern gaming standards.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"GameWall 240Hz LED Display | Ultra-Smooth 